Z||000000||pherder||06-16-2000||11:50 AM||||Where is what I just got ...<P>A set of Z Racing wheels ... 16 x 7 w/40MM offset.  225 50 16 tires (Dunlop 8000)<P>The jack is there because no strut is installed yet.<P>  <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=208525&a=1537447&p=22818322&Sequence=0">  <P>And here I am doing a little front end work ...<P>  <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=208525&a=1537447&p=22818325&Sequence=0">  <P>A-Arms are being powder coated, new bearings, the uprights have been powder coated (silver) and you can see the Fiero Store front spring (in the car's color! an unexpected turn of events), poly bushings, tie rod ends, and new ball joints to be installed.<P>Paul<p>[This message has been edited by pherder (edited 06-16-2000).]||||reg||10
