Z||000003||pherder||06-16-2000||01:35 PM||||The wheels are the same for all four corners.  <P>And yes the tires are directional.  This just happened to be the first tire I grabbed to see how they would fit/look on a Fiero.<P>Also, this wheel had a cover with the Z Racing sticker on it at this time so for a trial fit, I just used that wheel.  I haven't gotten the sticker on the other covers yet, just brought them home.<P>Now for the great part ... the wheels were on sale for $75 each.<P>Actually, I don't even know if they will go on this car.  They may end up on the GT and the GT's Gold wheels on this car.  The Coupe was the only one (of the three) that I could get the wheel on without taking one off.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>I really need to see how it will fit the front but as you can see, I need to do a little work before I can check it on this car.  <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Paul||||reg||1
