Z||000007||pherder||06-16-2000||10:17 PM||||As pointed out by Eric ... I have edited the start of this thread to make the 255 into the correct 225.<P>I got them on sale (until June 3rd) at NTB which is a SEARS tire and battery store.<P>They are Z Racing model 62 and like I stated above, are 16 by 7 with 40 MM offset.  I thought that I would have to put a spacer on the rear wheels to get them out far enough but looking at them on the car, I don't think it is needed.<P>Paul||||reg||1
